{"conversation_evidence":{"admissible_pre_tfg_turns":[{"create_time":1713677509.62073,"event_index":2,"role":"user","source_node_id":"aaa2bc6d-d807-4f80-a1ad-86f7de04cae3","source_parent_id":"857d7f78-19ef-4bda-b2a2-7336ae055e0f","source_record_index":2,"text":"What is tailwindcss and can you make a simple code snippet that shows its use and what it does?","turn_id":"turn_000002"}],"first_generation":{"artifacts":[{"candidate_id":"GTC_000003_000345_000837_ceb9cf617461e877","completeness":"complete","container":"markdown_fence","continuation_status":"none","detector":{"name":"generated-technical-content-v2","version":"2"},"detector_evidence":["complete_standalone_markdown_fence","nested_root_structure","recognized_software_markup"],"end_offset":837,"fence_language":"html","kind":"structured_xml_markup","legacy_artifact_id":"ARTIFACT_000003_001","order_within_response":1,"raw_text":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Tailwind CSS Example</title>\n  <!-- Include Tailwind CSS -->\n  <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/tailwindcss@2.2.19/dist/tailwind.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<!-- Example button using Tailwind CSS -->\n<button class=\"bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded\">\n  Button\n</button>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n","raw_text_sha256":"ceb9cf617461e877b909a055925b9edbc91d02ec5fd43e4975e534bc904b211c","source_event_index":3,"source_record_index":3,"source_response_id":"turn_000003","source_turn_text_sha256":"5073c70a47729fe5465204782340ce1d9e59b9a41e3c36553f3f2d25015894b4","start_offset":345,"status":"candidate_requires_semantic_review"}],"identification":{"ambiguity_reason":"","artifact_refs":["GTC_000003_000345_000837_ceb9cf617461e877"],"boundary":"exclusive_before:turn_000003","candidate_artifact_ids":["GTC_000003_000345_000837_ceb9cf617461e877"],"family_id":"FGF_5a366b4353a68bf3c8879e30","family_id_provenance":{"algorithm":"sha256","canonical_input":{"artifact_ids":["GTC_000003_000345_000837_ceb9cf617461e877"],"case_id":"CASE_A46532387B1B"},"canonicalization":"json-sort-keys-compact-utf8","case_id_included":true,"digest_hex":"5a366b4353a68bf3c8879e3047517864409562a13e9ceabc7db050d711c198e1","digest_prefix_length":24},"family_label":"Tailwind CSS HTML button example","rationale":"The earliest generated technical-content family is the standalone HTML example demonstrating Tailwind CSS utility classes on a button. It was generated in turn_000003 in direct response to the request in turn_000002.","response_event_index":3,"response_turn_id":"turn_000003","status":"complete","target_prompt_event_index":2,"target_prompt_id":"turn_000002"}},"first_generation_response":{"create_time":1713677515.125883,"event_index":3,"role":"assistant","source_node_id":"2292e1bd-7de2-4dc9-abdb-5e97879a9ea5","source_parent_id":"aaa2bc6d-d807-4f80-a1ad-86f7de04cae3","source_record_index":3,"text":"Tailwind CSS is a utility-first CSS framework that provides low-level utility classes to build custom designs quickly. It allows you to create designs by composing utility classes directly in your HTML markup, rather than writing custom CSS.\n\nHere's a simple code snippet demonstrating the use of Tailwind CSS to create a basic button:\n\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Tailwind CSS Example</title>\n  <!-- Include Tailwind CSS -->\n  <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/tailwindcss@2.2.19/dist/tailwind.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<!-- Example button using Tailwind CSS -->\n<button class=\"bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded\">\n  Button\n</button>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n\nIn this example:\n- The `bg-blue-500` class sets the background color of the button to a shade of blue.\n- The `hover:bg-blue-700` class changes the background color to a darker shade of blue when the button is hovered over.\n- The `text-white` class sets the text color to white.\n- The `font-bold` class makes the text bold.\n- The `py-2` and `px-4` classes add padding to the top and bottom (`py`) and left and right (`px`) of the button, respectively.\n- The `rounded` class adds rounded corners to the button.\n\nThese utility classes allow you to quickly style elements without having to write custom CSS, making it easy to create consistent and responsive designs.","turn_id":"turn_000003"},"target_developer_prompt":{"create_time":1713677509.62073,"event_index":2,"role":"user","source_node_id":"aaa2bc6d-d807-4f80-a1ad-86f7de04cae3","source_parent_id":"857d7f78-19ef-4bda-b2a2-7336ae055e0f","source_record_index":2,"text":"What is tailwindcss and can you make a simple code snippet that shows its use and what it does?","turn_id":"turn_000002"}},"csv_extraction":{"context":[{"category":"context","evidence_spans":["What is tailwindcss"],"item_id":"context_1","normalized_text":"The task concerns Tailwind CSS and its usage.","source_roles":["user"],"source_turn_ids":["turn_000002"]}],"specificity":[{"category":"specificity","evidence_spans":["What is tailwindcss"],"item_id":"specificity_1","normalized_text":"Explain what Tailwind CSS is.","source_roles":["user"],"source_turn_ids":["turn_000002"]},{"category":"specificity","evidence_spans":["can you make a simple code snippet that shows its use"],"item_id":"specificity_2","normalized_text":"Provide a simple code snippet demonstrating Tailwind CSS.","source_roles":["user"],"source_turn_ids":["turn_000002"]}],"verification":[{"category":"verification","evidence_spans":["a simple code snippet that shows its use and what it does"],"item_id":"verification_1","normalized_text":"The code snippet should show how Tailwind CSS is used and what it does.","source_roles":["user"],"source_turn_ids":["turn_000002"]}]},"identity":{"case_id":"CASE_A4653